* ============================================================
* SQL MATRIX X32 CURRENT-DATA SMOKE
* ============================================================
* Purpose:
*   Concrete the decision that SQL/index shakedown scripts must use
*   current generated MCC data, not old Grimwood/Derald test rows.
*
* Scope:
*   Non-destructive.
*   X32 data only.
*   Uses current known TEACHERS and STUDENTS rows.
*
* Confirms:
*   - WORKSPACE OPEN DBF uses configured X32 DBF slot.
*   - SQL predicates work against current data.
*   - CNX order activation does not break SQL scans.
*   - Grimwood is only used as a negative-control test.
*
* Notes:
*   Do not paste transcript output into this file.
*   Do not include prompt dots.
*   Do not end with RETURN.
* ============================================================

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SQL MATRIX X32 CURRENT-DATA SMOKE
ECHO ============================================================

ECHO
ECHO --- SET X32 PATHS AND CLEAN WORKSPACE ---
DO X32
WORKSPACE CLOSE
WORKSPACE OPEN DBF
WORKSPACE

ECHO
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO TEACHERS CURRENT-DATA TESTS
ECHO ============================================================

SELECT TEACHERS
AREA
LIST 20

ECHO
ECHO --- TEACHERS / NATURAL ORDER ---
TOP
SQL FOR LNAME = Wilson
SQL FOR LNAME = Wilson AND FNAME = Sam
SQL FOR LNAME = White
SQL FOR DEPT_ID = HIST
SQL FOR TENURED = T

ECHO
ECHO --- TEACHERS / NEGATIVE CONTROL ---
SQL FOR LNAME = Grimwood
SQL FOR LNAME = Grimwood AND FNAME = Derald

ECHO
ECHO --- TEACHERS / CNX ORDER LNAME ---
SETORDER teachers.cnx lname
AREA
TOP
SQL FOR LNAME = Wilson
SQL FOR LNAME = White
SQL FOR DEPT_ID = HIST
SQL FOR TENURED = T

ECHO
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO STUDENTS CURRENT-DATA TESTS
ECHO ============================================================

SELECT STUDENTS
AREA
LIST 20

ECHO
ECHO --- STUDENTS / NATURAL OR CURRENT ORDER ---
TOP
SQL FOR LNAME = Taylor
SQL FOR LNAME = Taylor AND FNAME = Quinn
SQL FOR LNAME = Martin
SQL FOR MAJOR = CSCI
SQL FOR GPA >= 3.5
SQL FOR GPA < 2.5

ECHO
ECHO --- STUDENTS / NEGATIVE CONTROL ---
SQL FOR LNAME = Grimwood
SQL FOR LNAME = Grimwood AND FNAME = Derald

ECHO
ECHO --- STUDENTS / CNX ORDER LNAME ---
SETORDER students.cnx lname
AREA
TOP
SQL FOR LNAME = Taylor
SQL FOR LNAME = Martin
SQL FOR MAJOR = CSCI
SQL FOR GPA >= 3.5

ECHO
ECHO --- STUDENTS / CNX ORDER MAJOR ---
SETORDER students.cnx major
AREA
TOP
SQL FOR MAJOR = CSCI
SQL FOR MAJOR = HIST
SQL FOR GPA >= 3.5

ECHO
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SQL MATRIX X32 CURRENT-DATA SMOKE DONE
ECHO ============================================================